# Orcish Conscripts' "can't attack unless at least two other creatures
# attack" (AttackRestriction.java:98-100, :63): with one Grizzly Bears the
# declaration is illegal; with both it is legal.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
expecterror 508.1c declareattackers
queue attackers 1,2,3
declareattackers
